                "reviews": [
                    {
                        "recommendationid": "44022287",
                        "author": {
                            "steamid": "76561198339334340",
                            "num_reviews": 2,
                            "playtime_forever": 354,
                            "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0,
                            "playtime_at_review": 118,
                            "last_played": 1538502210
                        },
                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "So far (a couple of hours played), all I can say is \"¡such a surprise!\" I was interested on this game since I hear about it, and the final result is better than what I expected. \n\nThe first thing that I really love, is the way you fight. It is much more natural and fluid than most of other jrpg´s I played before, it is really fun, and you don´t get tired of repeating mechanics as it happens in other games. The design of scenarios and characters (including enemies) is simple, but both are quite cool and work well. Characters background are very interesting so far, you want to know more about them, it happens the same with the story that looks like quite epic ¡wondering what´s going to happen next!.\n\nThe music is excelent, it deserves to be commented, is really beautiful and perfectly fits with what´s happening on screen.\n\nI am playing this with a ps4 joystick, and works well. Also with keyboard, commands are quite easy to execute, but personally i preffer joystick (steam one is at home, during this holidays)\nInterfaz is easy to use, and the hability tree is not the best but it is enough in my opinion.\n\nIt is a game you should try and give it a chance, also quite unexpensive according to its final result and what it offers.",
